SUMMARY:MOG Events
DESCRIPTION:The Children’s Museum’s Museum-on-the-Go (MOG) program delivers playful transformative experiences to the greater Sonoma County area\, and brings unique programming to children who may not otherwise get the opportunity to visit our permanent Santa Rosa location. \n\n\n\n\nClick here to see where MOG is headed next!
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/mog-museum-on-the-go/2026-10-30/
